Rock original
Original at "service" is "orders"
Original at "features" is "metrics"
Original at "description" is "original=orders: metrics"

Rock canary
Put original at "service" into canary at "service"
Put original at "features" into canary at "features"
Put original at "description" into canary at "description"
Canary at "service" is "orders-canary"
Canary at "features" is "metrics,tracing"
Canary at "description" is "clone=orders-canary: metrics,tracing"

Print original at "description"
Print canary at "description"
